  "description": "Jin-Hu, whose family was ruined by Mu-Hul’s organization in the past, has infiltrated the organization, biding his time for the moment to take revenge on Mu-Hul. While doing so, he learns about Mu-Hul’s slush fund ledger, and just as he is about to betray Mu-Hul, who trusts him more readily than he expected, he gets caught red-handed...\n\n *“Don’t worry. I’ll fix you, you lying brother.”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
